        "summary" : "Get Limit Hierarchy objects.",
        "description" : "Get a collection of `Limit Hierarchy` objects.\nThe result set can be restricted through filter parameter.\nOnly `Limit Hierarchy` objects will be returned that can be accessed by the user (security applied).\nPaging is supported with parameters *limit* and *offset*.\n",
